    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'A factory located near a residential area burns coal as fuel. Residents complain about eye irritation and breathing difficulties, especially on windy days. Which pollutant is most likely responsible?', '["Nitrogen","Sulphur dioxide","Argon","Helium"]'::jsonb, 'B', 1, '6dc01b7df7bf', null),
    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'During a traffic jam inside a tunnel, several drivers begin feeling dizzy and weak. Which gas is most likely accumulating in the tunnel?', '["Oxygen","Carbon dioxide","Carbon monoxide","Methane"]'::jsonb, 'C', 1, '62526cf76a7b', null),
    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'A city records increasing cases of asthma during summer afternoons. Scientists find high levels of ozone near the ground. The ozone was most likely formed by:', '["Nitrogen and oxygen mixing naturally","Reactions between NOₓ, VOCs, and sunlight","Evaporation of water","Condensation of air pollutants"]'::jsonb, 'B', 1, '6bd4f80994cb', null),
    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'A student notices that marble statues near an industrial zone are slowly losing their shine and surface details. The most likely cause is:', '["Ozone depletion","Acid rain","Methane emission","Nitrogen fixation"]'::jsonb, 'B', 1, '838b26aecad7', null),
    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'Farmers observe that crops growing near a busy highway show reduced growth and leaf damage. Which pollutant is most directly involved?', '["Ground-level ozone","Nitrogen gas","Argon","Helium"]'::jsonb, 'A', 1, '96d0a4bd17d8', null),
    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'A family uses a charcoal stove inside a poorly ventilated room. Which safety risk is greatest?', '["Methane poisoning","Carbon monoxide poisoning","Ozone poisoning","Nitrogen poisoning"]'::jsonb, 'B', 1, '3a3d90b9e4c1', null),
    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'A scientist finds increasing methane emissions from a landfill. What environmental effect is most likely?', '["Ozone layer formation","Greenhouse effect enhancement","Acid rain formation","Increased oxygen concentration"]'::jsonb, 'B', 1, 'ee0b2899fed5', null),
    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'After heavy industrial activity, rainwater collected in an area has a pH of 4.2. This indicates:', '["Normal rainwater","Acid rain","Distilled water","Neutral water"]'::jsonb, 'B', 1, '29431e5d738c', null),
    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'A vehicle engine is not properly maintained and fuel burns incompletely. Which pollutant will increase significantly?', '["Carbon monoxide","Oxygen","Nitrogen","Argon"]'::jsonb, 'A', 1, 'c55db6a0b875', null),
